sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Understanding a request precedes authorized business fulfillment
accDescr: Connect and Lex gather the caller intent and missing fields, then a Lambda fulfillment path invokes a business API that enforces caller authorization before returning a result.
participant C as Caller
participant L as Connect and Lex
participant F as Lambda fulfillment
participant B as Business API
C->>L: Spoken request
L-->>C: Ask for required details
C->>L: Supply missing information
L->>F: Intent and collected fields
F->>B: Request with caller identity context
B->>B: Enforce authentication and authorization
B-->>F: Authorized result or denial
F-->>L: Fulfillment response
L-->>C: Spoken result or next step
